<title>USA: Hicks, Muse starts Circo Craft tender.</title>
<headline>Hicks, Muse starts Circo Craft tender.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. private investment firm Hicks, Muse, Tate and Furst Inc said it began its previously-announced tender offer for Circo Craft Co Inc at a cash price of C$11 per share.</p>
<p>The offer is subject to certain conditions, including that at least 66 percent of the common shares be tendered on a fully-diluted basis.</p>
<p>The offer will expire at 12:01 a.m. Montreal time on September 28, unless extended or withdrawn.</p>
<p>The soliciting dealer is RBC Dominion Securities Inc, the firm said in a statement released over the weekend.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
